  "supportedClaim": "For the canonical exact-launch profile r_l=l,z_l=1, chi_M=1/(2M) and Omega^2/Kv is asymptotic to 12/M. With M/Ks asymptotic to 3/M^2, the normalized geometric prefactor is M^-10/3 and the sufficient phase boundary is alpha<min(5/2,(10+3beta)/7). The one-carrier Bessel layer remains earlier than the frozen-profile enhanced-dissipation comparison scale."
